  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-26-655: The project, 451 4th Street, located at 451 4th Street in San Jose on a 0.52 acre site, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $7,090,774 in annual federal tax credits and $39,176,819 of tax-exempt bond cap to finance the new construction of 372 units of housing, consisting of 368 restricted rental units and 4 unrestricted manager's units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001610"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The staff report gives 451 4th Street with no direction; APN taken from the county parcel at 451 S 4th St, ZIP 95112 per the report.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001610"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City permit layer folder H26-037 describes a Site Development Permit for a 100% affordable, 15-story, 372-unit multifamily building with demolition of a single-family residence and a 31-unit multifamily building on about 0.52 gross acres; applicant American Housing Company 1 LLC.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001956"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The site spans APNs 467-47-058 (451 S 4th St) and 467-47-096 (439 S 4th St). The earlier South Fourth Street Project (H17-004) proposed a 25-story, 274-foot building with up to 210 units on the same two parcels.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002299",
        "SRC-001956"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC staff report: census tract 5009.01, average targeted affordability 59.95% AMI, 40%/60% average income set-aside, project analyst listed, general partners American Housing Company 1 and Central Valley Coalition for Affordable Housing.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001610"
      ]
    }
  ],
